The Appeal Screening Agent reviews post-decision outcomes to determine whether there are valid grounds for appeal or review. It analyzes tribunal orders, party submissions, and compliance status to identify potential procedural or substantive lapses that could justify an appeal. This ensures timely and well-founded escalation of cases when warranted under the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (IBC).";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761649505;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761649505;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:70:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:review_analysis:appeal_screening_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:979;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}